-036-wei-comparison"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0403","start":403,"end":404,"surface":"晦","kind":"person","person_id":"y2b_2mj_02k","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0447","start":447,"end":448,"surface":"晦","kind":"person","person_id":"y2b_2mj_02k","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0458","start":458,"end":459,"surface":"晦","kind":"person","person_id":"y2b_2mj_02k","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0463","start":463,"end":464,"surface":"晦","kind":"person","person_id":"y2b_2mj_02k","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-jin036-wei-ronghui","person_id":"y2b_2mj_02k","surfaces":["榮晦","晦"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-036","source_id":"s-jinshu036-wei-ws2108231-rendered-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p009","quote":"初，瓘為司空，時帳下督榮晦有罪，瓘斥遣之。及難作，隨兵討瓘，故子孫皆及於禍。","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p009:m0011"]},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-036","source_id":"s-jinshu036-wei-ws2108231-rendered-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010","quote":"楚王瑋之伏誅也，瓘女與國臣書曰：「先公名諡未顯，無異凡人，每怪一國蔑然無言。《春秋》之失，其咎安在？悲憤感慨，故以示意。」於是繇等執黃幡，撾登聞鼓，上言曰：「初，矯詔者至，公承詔當免，即便奉送章綬，雖有兵仗，不施一刃，重敕出第，單車從命。如矯詔之文唯免公官，右軍以下即承詐偽，違其本文，輒戮宰輔，不復表上，橫收公子孫輒皆行刑，賊害大臣父子九人。伏見詔書『為楚王所誑誤，非本同謀者皆弛遣』。如書之旨，謂裏舍人被驅逼齎白杖者耳。律，受教殺人，不得免死。況乎手害功臣，賊殺忠良，雖云非謀，理所不赦。今元惡雖誅，殺賊猶存。臣懼有司未詳事實，或有縱漏，不加精盡，使公父子仇賊不滅，冤魂永恨，訴於穹蒼，酷痛之臣，悲於明世。臣等身被創痍，殯斂始訖。謹條瓘前在司空時，帳下給使榮晦無情被黜，知瓘家人數、小孫名字。晦後轉給右軍，其夜晦在門外揚聲大呼，宣詔免公還第。及門開，晦前到中門，復讀所齎偽詔，手取公章綬貂蟬，催公出第。晦按次錄瓘家口及其子孫，皆兵仗將送，著東亭道北圍守，一時之間，便皆斬斫。害公子孫，實由於晦。及將人劫盜府庫，皆晦所為。考晦一人，眾奸皆出。乞驗盡情偽，加以族誅。」詔從之。","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0330","c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0348","c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0357","c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0377","c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0403","c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0447","c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0458","c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0463"]}],"rationale":"完整本傳/嵌入書勢/引語時層逐處判讀。榮晦〔瓘帳下督〕；不是全域同字配對，未由本次標記推任官、同場或親屬世距。","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p009","text":"初，瓘為司空，時帳下督榮晦有罪，瓘斥遣之。及難作，隨兵討瓘，故子孫皆及於禍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","captured_source_position":{"unit_key":"p009","projection_ref":"source-evidence/jin036-wei-comparison/projection.json","capture_sha256":"6db27cbd14cb251ba7ab4e58e9064b02d808cd893b02c044e359c7ccedd73659","source_response_sha256":"6dc95bd5962acbb6d2e8d3854ee215d7693d07f11b5224e5bcaa53af7d531dfb","capture_kind":"fixed_revision_HTML_rendered_text_extract","revision_id":2108231,"parsed_block_index":11},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p009:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"瓘","kind":"person","person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p009:m0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"榮晦","kind":"person","person_id":"y2b_2mj_02k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p009:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"瓘","kind":"person","person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p009:m0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"瓘","kind":"person","person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison","book_id":"b-jinshu-036","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu036-wei-ws2108231-rendered-comparison"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010","text":"楚王瑋之伏誅也，瓘女與國臣書曰：「先公名諡未顯，無異凡人，每怪一國蔑然無言。《春秋》之失，其咎安在？悲憤感慨，故以示意。」於是繇等執黃幡，撾登聞鼓，上言曰：「初，矯詔者至，公承詔當免，即便奉送章綬，雖有兵仗，不施一刃，重敕出第，單車從命。如矯詔之文唯免公官，右軍以下即承詐偽，違其本文，輒戮宰輔，不復表上，橫收公子孫輒皆行刑，賊害大臣父子九人。伏見詔書『為楚王所誑誤，非本同謀者皆弛遣』。如書之旨，謂裏舍人被驅逼齎白杖者耳。律，受教殺人，不得免死。況乎手害功臣，賊殺忠良，雖云非謀，理所不赦。今元惡雖誅，殺賊猶存。臣懼有司未詳事實，或有縱漏，不加精盡，使公父子仇賊不滅，冤魂永恨，訴於穹蒼，酷痛之臣，悲於明世。臣等身被創痍，殯斂始訖。謹條瓘前在司空時，帳下給使榮晦無情被黜，知瓘家人數、小孫名字。晦後轉給右軍，其夜晦在門外揚聲大呼，宣詔免公還第。及門開，晦前到中門，復讀所齎偽詔，手取公章綬貂蟬，催公出第。晦按次錄瓘家口及其子孫，皆兵仗將送，著東亭道北圍守，一時之間，便皆斬斫。害公子孫，實由於晦。及將人劫盜府庫，皆晦所為。考晦一人，眾奸皆出。乞驗盡情偽，加以族誅。」詔從之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","captured_source_position":{"unit_key":"p010","projection_ref":"source-evidence/jin036-wei-comparison/projection.json","capture_sha256":"6db27cbd14cb251ba7ab4e58e9064b02d808cd893b02c044e359c7ccedd73659","source_response_sha256":"6dc95bd5962acbb6d2e8d3854ee215d7693d07f11b5224e5bcaa53af7d531dfb","capture_kind":"fixed_revision_HTML_rendered_text_extract","revision_id":2108231,"parsed_block_index":12},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"楚王瑋","kind":"person","person_id":"20b_1c2_a06","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"瓘","kind":"person","person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"女","kind":"person","person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p010:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"先公","kind":"person","person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AA","status":"contextual_provisio